  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual assessed contribution over four calendar year-period 2016-2019 to the United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding of the mandatory annual assessed contribution to UNESCO for calendar years 2016 - 2019 inclusive, covering the organisation&apos;s programme which includes Education, Science, Culture and Communication. Key programmes include the Education For All policy, Global Monitoring Report, Global Tsunami warning system, protection of Culture and World Heritage, Safety of Journalists and Freedom of Expression. Full details are in UNESCO&apos;s Programme and Budget.</narrative>
  </description>
